<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#b">Gei&#x017F;ter</hi><lb/>
und<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Gei&#x017F;ter&#x017F;eher</hi><lb/>
oder</hi><lb/>
Leben und fru&#x0364;hes Ende<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">eines<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Nekromanti&#x017F;ten.</hi></hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<docTitle><titlePart type="sub"><hi rendition="#g">Eine<lb/>
warnende Anekdote un&#x017F;rer Zeit</hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#g">von</hi><lb/>
<docAuthor>J. H. <hi rendition="#g">Z&#x017F;ch***</hi>.</docAuthor></byline><lb/>
